## 思路

**动态规划**(原地或拷贝):`dp[i][j] = grid[i][j] + min(dp[i-1][j], dp[i][j-1])`,首行/首列单独累加。返回右下角值。

## 参考代码

```js
function minPathSum(grid) {
  const m = grid.length;
  const n = grid[0].length;
  const dp = grid.map((row) => [...row]);
  for (let i = 0; i < m; i++) {
    for (let j = 0; j < n; j++) {
      if (i === 0 && j === 0) continue;
      if (i === 0) dp[i][j] += dp[i][j - 1];
      else if (j === 0) dp[i][j] += dp[i - 1][j];
      else dp[i][j] += Math.min(dp[i - 1][j], dp[i][j - 1]);
    }
  }
  return dp[m - 1][n - 1];
}
```

## 复杂度

- 时间:O(m*n)
- 空间:O(m*n)(可优化为原地 O(1) 额外)
